@startuml Section05_Pattern_Builder
!theme plain

title Design Pattern: Builder Pattern (ビルダーパターン)

' Product
class GameSettings <<Product>> {
  +Bounds BoardBounds
  +Position InitialPlayerPosition
  +Position InitialEnemyPosition
  +Position InitialLizardPosition
  +int UpdateIntervalMs
  +double EnemyMoveProbability
  +int LizardFleeDistance
  +int LizardTailDropDistance
  --
  +{static} GameSettings Default()
  +{static} Builder CreateBuilder()
}

' Builder
class "GameSettings.Builder" as Builder <<Builder>> {
  -int _boardWidth = 32
  -int _boardHeight = 32
  -Position? _playerPosition
  -Position? _enemyPosition
  -Position? _lizardPosition
  -int _updateIntervalMs = 200
  -double _enemyMoveProbability = 1.0
  -int _lizardFleeDistance = 8
  -int _lizardTailDropDistance = 4
  --
  +Builder WithBoardSize(int width, int height)
  +Builder WithPlayerPosition(Position position)
  +Builder WithEnemyPosition(Position position)
  +Builder WithLizardPosition(Position position)
  +Builder WithUpdateInterval(int milliseconds)
  +Builder WithEnemyMoveProbability(double probability)
  +Builder WithLizardFleeDistance(int distance)
  +Builder WithLizardTailDropDistance(int distance)
  +GameSettings Build()
}

' Relationships
GameSettings +-- Builder : creates
Builder ..> GameSettings : builds

note top of Builder
  Builder Pattern

  目的:
  複雑なオブジェクトの構築を
  ステップバイステップで行う

  メリット:
  - 流暢なインターフェース (Fluent Interface)
  - 複雑な設定の段階的構築
  - デフォルト値の提供
  - 読みやすいコード
end note

note right of Builder
  使用例:

  var settings = GameSettings
    .CreateBuilder()
    .WithBoardSize(40, 40)
    .WithUpdateInterval(100)
    .WithLizardFleeDistance(10)
    .Build();

  メソッドチェーンで
  流暢に設定を構築
end note

note bottom of GameSettings
  Product

  不変オブジェクト:
  - 作成後の変更不可
  - すべてのプロパティがreadonly

  デフォルト設定:
  var settings = GameSettings.Default();
end note

@enduml
